OL,3,GNEWSABike gangs dangerous, police
OL,4,Acommissioner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGangs using off-road bikes and
OL,7,Fe-scooters have been branded
OL,8,F"dangerous" as police attempt to crack
OL,9,Fdown on the issue.
OL,11,FStaffordshire Police recently arrested
OL,12,F29 people and seized more than 100
OL,13,Fillegal vehicles across the county as
OL,14,Fpart of the force's efforts.
OL,16,FIt came after officers received reports
OL,17,Fof bikes being used to tear up grass in
OL,18,Fparks and at sports clubs, with riders
OL,19,Foften pulling dangerous stunts on
OL,20,Fresidential streets.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
